(text "C560 is local to U1 AH27; C486 remains local to RK809.\nRK809 RESETB and the 3.3V pull-up share SYS_RESET_L.\nConfigure TSADC/watchdog output active LOW before use.\nR561 follows the Rockchip reference and can isolate TSHUT for debug." (at 205.74 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a89405-2e1e-5865-a388-88b6794ec3bf"))
(text "Rockchip HW Guide V1.2 pp6–10; tablet reference p13.\nReset must remain asserted for at least 100 cycles of 24MHz. Power-good, manual reset and brownout recovery are still unfinished.\nUnused PMU pins are explicitly disconnected; development IO will use the powered 3.3V peripheral banks." (at 15.24 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1e6faad-a0fc-5f35-b9ea-19293afd47bd"))
